@vijaya-ops  Please add techsupport

Workaround: Set the following entry in config_db when macsec or pac is enabled through feature command.

```
    "COPP_TRAP": {
        "eapol": {
            "always_enabled": "true"
        }
    }
```

By default the copp_cfg.j2 should contain the following entry

```
	    "eapol": {
		    "trap_ids": "eapol",
		    "trap_group": "queue4_group1"
	    },
```
